      "8b3622a6-f135-42eb-90e9-e5b199bc4feb",
      4,
      "Part 4: Crash Course Validation Rules and Integrity Gates",
      "This chapter establishes the rigorous Level 1 through Level 3 validation gates that govern document syntax, bidirectional manifest linkages, and transactional referential integrity. It covers fail-on-switch constraints, precise error code ranges spanning `E_INVALID_FIELDS` (Code 6) through `E_MFDB_FK_UNRESOLVED` (Code 39), and pre-write atomic commit gates. This completes the operational blueprint required to deploy zero-daemon, hallucination-free relational data engines in production environments.\n\nTarget length: about 150 words.",
